kkelde. Ook gesprekken met familie en ervaringen rond lichamelijkheid krijgen een plaats. Het boek ontstond mede uit de behoefte uit te leggen wat non-binair en aseksueel voor de auteur betekenen. De persoonlijke vorm maakt zichtbaar hoeveel vragen en onzekerheden achter ogenschijnlijk eenvoudige categorieën kunnen schuilgaan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL21337755W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p438685180"],"reference":"work:854","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.676Z","note":"MaiaKobabe2019 graphicmemoir, exact Dutch9789002277986. Personal nonbinary/asexual narrative, not a medical textbook or conventional novel; no type/taste inference.","supplemental":null,"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-017.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL21337755W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p438685180"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL60598610M","isbn13":"9789002277986","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.677Z","note":"Exact bounded bulk source did not provide a verified asset; reuse unchanged resolver and inspect actual front or neutral placeholder hosted. No arbitrary image or absent-book claim.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15139398,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"8529a8efea33798915ea378cecc82a7765e1800b8ec34536875c4a996d541fc7"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T08:16:03.676Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-040"}},{"ref":"m8","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_i